type="Text" class="sc-eGJWMs gQYBcx pf-97_">WHAT’S IN THE carton?</span></h3><p class="sc-TtZnY fPBQTR pf-98_ intheBoxCopy" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eGJWMs gQYBcx pf-100_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">COCONUT CREAM</span> <br>We use the creamiest part of the coconut to achieve an irresistibly rich and luxurious texture. <br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">FUNCTIONAL MUSHROOM EXTRACT BLEND (CHAGA, CORDYCEPS, AND LION’S MANE) </span><br>We combined our favorite functional mushrooms, which have been valued in Eastern medicine for hundreds of years.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;"> AQUAMIN <br></span>A calcified red sea algae, naturally rich source in calcium, and 72 minerals in trace amounts. <br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">ORGANIC COCONUT SUGAR <br></span>This low-glycemic alternative to traditional cane sugar adds the perfect touch of subtle sweetness. <br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">ORGANIC GUM ACACIA <br></span>This naturally occurring soluble fiber, derived from the Acacia Tree, helps maintain the creamy consistency of our creamer.<br><br> Learn more about our plant-based <a href="https://lairdsuperfood.com/pages/laird-superfood-ingredients" style="font-weight:bold; color:rgb(245, 127, 31);">ingredients</a>.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-ckTSus kVjkXt pf-101_"><div style="--cw:1475px" class="sc-gGLxEB dGJRan"><div class="sc-iwajpm kydRHc pf-102_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;--s-sm:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-oeezt OJJCp pf-103_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gXfVKN hOTIIO pf-104_ cartonHeadline"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eGJWMs gQYBcx pf-106_">How to make the perfect cup in 4 easy steps:</span></h3><div data-pf-type="Youtube" class="sc-bsatvv gHEtUc pf-107_"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe class="pf-ifr" src="https://www